.TH SCI 1 "2026-09" "sci-disclose" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sci \- Software Carbon Intensity (SCI) from the command line
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sci
.I target
.RI [ flags ]
.RI [ argument ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sci
measures the Software Carbon Intensity of a workload. SCI, as specified by the
Green Software Foundation and standardised as ISO/IEC 21031:2024, is a rate,
not a total:
.PP
.RS
SCI = ((E x I) + M) per R
.RE
.PP
.TP
.B E
Energy consumed by the software system, in kWh.
.TP
.B I
Location-based grid carbon intensity, in gCO2e/kWh.
.TP
.B M
Embodied emissions of the hardware it runs on, in gCO2e.
.TP
.B R
The functional unit the rate is expressed per, e.g. one API call.
.PP
A repository, a file or a function has no SCI until something runs. Every
target therefore either runs a workload and measures it, or reads a manifest in
which one is declared. Nothing here infers carbon from source code alone.
.SH TARGETS
.TP
.B sci run \-\- \fIcommand\fR
Measure a command.
.TP
.B sci file \fIbench.py\fR
Measure a script; the interpreter is chosen by extension.
.TP
.B sci func \fImypkg.bench:main\fR \-n \fI200\fR
Measure a function, per call.
.TP
.B sci repo \fI.\fR
Measure a repository, via its own test or build command.
.TP
.B sci estimate \-f \fIsci.yaml\fR
Report a declared deployment; nothing is executed.
.TP
.B sci init \fI.\fR
Scaffold
.I sci.yaml
from the repository.
.TP
.B sci units \-units \fIN\fR \fIdisclosure.json\fR
Divide an existing measurement by a count established later.
.TP
.B sci compare \fIbefore.json\fR \fIafter.json\fR
Report two runs as a delta.
.TP
.B sci coefficients
Every constant used, with its source.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Fine.
.TP
.B 1
Over budget, or a regression.
.TP
.B 2
Usage or configuration error.
.TP
.B 3
The measured workload itself failed.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I sci.yaml
Declared deployment manifest, as written by
.BR "sci init" .
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Measure a test suite:
.PP
.RS
.B sci run \-\- pytest \-q
.RE
.PP
Compare two runs:
.PP
.RS
.B sci compare before.json after.json
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
ISO/IEC 21031:2024. Project documentation:
.UR https://github.com/fabiocicerchia/sci-disclose
.UE
